Task 4.1 - Implement mobile-first responsive design for all pages - is now complete.

## Summary

I've successfully implemented comprehensive mobile-first responsive design for the entire blog. Here's what was done:

### Changes Made:

1. **Layout & Navigation** (`app/layout.tsx`)
   - Added separate mobile navigation bar below the main header
   - Responsive header/footer sizing (px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8)
   - Reduced header height on mobile (h-14 sm:h-16)
   - Smaller logo text on mobile (text-lg sm:text-xl)

2. **Homepage** (`app/page.tsx`)
   - Responsive hero section typography
   - Features grid: 1 column on mobile → 2 on sm → 3 on lg
   - Reduced spacing on mobile

3. **Article Cards** (`components/article-card.tsx`)
   - Responsive padding (p-4 sm:p-6)
   - Responsive text sizes (text-lg sm:text-xl)
   - Smaller icons and tags on mobile

4. **Article Detail Page** (`app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx`)
   - Mobile-optimized typography (text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl)
   - Smaller prose sizing (prose-sm sm:prose-base)

5. **MDX Content** (`components/mdx-content.tsx`)
   - Mobile prose sizing (text-sm sm:text-base)
   - Responsive headings with scroll offsets
   - Table overflow handling with negative margin offset

6. **Code Blocks** (`components/code-block.tsx`)
   - Smaller font size on mobile (0.75rem)
   - Horizontal scroll wrapper
   - Hide "复制" text on mobile (show icon only)

7. **Search Box** (`components/search-box.tsx`)
   - Responsive input sizing
   - Smaller dropdown on mobile

8. **Back to Top** (`components/back-to-top.tsx`)
   - Smaller button on mobile (w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12)
   - Adjusted positioning

9. **Tag Filter** (`components/tag-filter.tsx`)
   - Responsive tag badges
   - Truncated text on mobile

10. **Tag & About Pages**
    - Mobile breadcrumb, spacing
    - Responsive grids, cards, icons

